k, the downstream impact on `payments-api`, and the next steps.\n- **Still failing:** `payments-api` is still degraded at an 18% error rate on v5.1.0, checked right after the worker rollback. The API may just need time to recover once the worker is healthy. Or its own v5.1.0 release may have a separate problem: its release history marks v5.1.0 as degraded.\n\nI haven't touched `payments-api`. If its errors don't drop soon, the next step would be rolling it back to v5.0.0, its last healthy release. Want me to check again in a few minutes, or do that rollback now?", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01XMXZaD2JFcP7eVQuqJ9MNx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01PyM7RAyqP7jXC52rjej7tw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01LZyaam776yWn2ymnMH6Gpi", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01UoRHTAc14CU5ZQV3TG9wFX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_014iXDbbsFA79L1LidTokejq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0186DP3BL4SadHKwLfEsZfXD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-gateway", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_012ZhiaJSvzMhyq2Ut