\n- **Incident:** I opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, `payments-worker`), which paged on-call. It records the bad v3.4.0 deploy, the rollback, the downstream impact on `payments-api`, and the next steps.\n- **Still failing:** `payments-api` is still degraded at an 18% error rate on v5.1.0, checked right after the worker rollback. The API may just need time to recover once the worker is healthy. Or its own v5.1.0 release may have a separate problem: its release history marks v5.1.0 as degraded.\n\nI haven't touched `payments-api`. If its errors don't drop soon, the next step would be rolling it back to v5.0.0, its last healthy release. Want me to check again in a few minutes, or do that rollback now?", "type": "text"}]}]}